  <DialogueName>k__BackingField: Caladin27
  <Text>k__BackingField: You sure? It's an important role... let me ask again. Want
    to become the official tinker of <style=location>Hammerstead</style>
  <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: I'll absolutely do it!
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5ab7c88b1e77fe4da738bfdb21bfb0f, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: There's nothing I'd rather do!
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5ab7c88b1e77fe4da738bfdb21bfb0f, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: What an honor, yes!
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e5ab7c88b1e77fe4da738bfdb21bfb0f, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: No thanks.
    LocalizeKey: LOCAL_CHOICE_KEY
    OutputID: 
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 181b90f4d5a9db141a4bd96e0af074d2, type: 2}
